==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ryoga Hibiki (Enemy)|Ryoga Hibiki]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Shampoo (Enemy)|Shampoo]] spawns.
**3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
**3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
**3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
**3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use any [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark]] units such as [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Weightlifter Cat]] and [[Cat Gunslinger (Rare Cat)|Rodeo Cat]] for the Shadow Boxer Ks. [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] trivializes this stage so bring him if you have him.

